<title>USA: Signal Apparel Co Inc cuts Q1 loss.</title>
<headline>Signal Apparel Co Inc cuts Q1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.46     loss	 $0.61</p>
<p> Net loss		   5,340     loss	 7,053</p>
<p> Revs			10,366		   19,505</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,578		   11,528</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 loss includes $2.7 million in accrued unpaid interest  to company's principal investor and a loss of $261,000 for the discontinued  knitwear business.</p>
